ssion\n23\ttest that failed before its fix.\n24\t\n25\t| Phase | Rounds | Findings | Blocking | Last verdict | Unread repair |\n26\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n27\t| LH1 | 2 | 8 | 6 | CHANGES_REQUESTED | `59fd62f0` (round 2 declared last) |\n28\t| LH2 | 1 | 3 | 1 | CHANGES_REQUESTED | `9df661c8` |\n29\t| LH3 | 2 | 5 | 2 | CHANGES_REQUESTED | `f718b572` (round 2 declared last) |\n30\t| LH4 | 1 | 2 | 1 | CHANGES_REQUESTED | `4428a24d` |\n31\t\n32\tThe close panel reads the code at the close commit, every unread repair\n33\tincluded.\n34\t\n35\t## Boundaries\n36\t\n37\t- No live provider ran; producers and reviewers in the tests are local\n38\t  objects. The corpus and provider-budget run stays with the\n39\t  literature-identity follow-up (H20).\n40\t- Time bounds are measured on one machine (Apple silicon).\n41\t- No stable command changed; `gnd judgments check`'s 1,024-target cap stands.\n42\t- The pull requests are open: #241 (reading pair) and #245 (admission pair,\n43\t  stacked on #241). Neither is merged."}
