inds the shape and rules digests and records `max_targets` and `max_rows`; changing any one changes the record; a call with rules and no shape writes `/2` with the shape `packaged` and `max_rows` `null` `(p2)` | none |\n401\t\n402\tEach phase also runs the structure and inventory guards, the\n403\twhole-repository `uv run ruff check` `(p1)`, an independent review of its\n404\tdiff, a refactoring review and its record.\n405\t\n406\t## 5. Documentation, skill and compatibility surfaces\n407\t\n408\t- **One home each.** The reading protocol, the profile, the limits and the\n409\t  `/2` manifest are described in\n410\t  `src/gnd/examples/literature/reading_fixture/README.md`, which already\n411\t  holds the stage files and the coverage states. The assertion shape, the\n412\t  admission rules and the `/2` record are described in the admission section\n413\t  of `src/gnd/examples/literature/README.md`. `docs/literature/commands.md`\n414\t  gains one short \"drive it from your host\" passage per example that links to\n415\t  those two homes and restates nothing normative.\n416\t- **Release notes.** One entry per pair under the unreleased heading of\n417\t  `docs/release-notes.md`, written by LH2 and LH4.\n418\t- **Skills.** No packaged skill names these functions; none changes.\n419\t- **Compatibility.** `SavedProducer.produce` takes one call object where it\n420\t  took two names; `test_ld3` patches it with a function that accepts any\n421\t  arguments. `test_ld3` also calls `_inspect` directly with six positional\n422\t  arguments and reads `SavedProducer.calls`, and patches `reading._read` on\n423\t  the replay path (H10). These stay: `_inspect` keeps its six positional\n424\t  parameters and its return shape, and every new parameter is keyword-only;\n425\t  `SavedProducer` keeps its `calls` counter, though the loop no longer needs\n426\t  one; `reading._read(folder, name)` stays the `/1` replay read path with its\n427\t  two positional parameters `(p1)`, and only a `/2